<title>USA: St Paul hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   61.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   60.50-61.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   59.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 1.00 higher. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   49.50-50.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   50.50-51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     550-700 lbs   52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
